/v1/","context":{"app_id":4712830,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4712830-1847286114037309","game_id":"steam-4712830","kind":"update","title":"Demo update 1.0.19: a smoother first hour","summary":"Howdy, partners! Everything in this update comes from your emails, forum posts and videos. Thank you! A clearer start: the tutorial walks you from the oil seep to your first sale, and the build bar opens up step by step as you need it. Tutorial steps stay on screen until you do them, and a click beside the buttons no longer closes a tip. Lost? Click Tex on the field and pick \"What now?\" to hear the next step again. Left-clicking a building or a derrick reminds you that the right mouse button ope","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T17:18:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114037309","verified_at":"2026-10-23T19:18:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4712830-1847286114030603","game_id":"steam-4712830","kind":"update","title":"Demo update 1.0.18: you asked, we listened","summary":"Howdy, partners! Everything in this update comes from your emails and forum posts. Thank you! Camera keys your way: rebind every camera key in Settings > Controls and choose what the mouse wheel does. Garages and warehouses keep a clear area in front of their gates, so trucks always have room to come and go. On a quiet field, trucks now drive straight from the garage to the tank. Tex's tips wait for you: a new tip no longer replaces the one you are reading. Easier branching: the drill bit follow","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T23:29:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030603","verified_at":"2026-10-21T23:51:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4712830-1846651706691452","game_id":"steam-4712830","kind":"announcement","title":"Texas Oil Baron is in Steam Next Fest: the free demo is waiting for you","summary":"Howdy, partners! Steam Next Fest is here and Texas Oil Baron is part of it. The free demo is ready to download, so grab your hard hat and come drill some Texas dirt. What you can do in the demo Meet Tex, a well-known and very cheerful local, and get your first plot of land Scan the ground with sonar and look for oil deposits deep under the field Steer the drill underground: add turns and branch one well into several deposits Pump oil into tanks or barrels, sell it to the local buyer or deliver i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691452","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4712830-1846651706688129","game_id":"steam-4712830","kind":"update","title":"Demo update 1.0.14 to 1.0.16: new camera controls and more","summary":"Howdy, partners! Three more demo updates are live (1.0.14 to 1.0.16), and once again most of it comes straight from your feedback on the forum and by email. Thank you, every message helps! Camera and controls New camera controls in the side view, the same above and below ground: W/S moves the camera up and down (underground and back to the surface), A/D left and right, and the mouse wheel or Q/E moves through the ground slices (away / toward you). The top-down drone view is unchanged. A camera c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T21:54:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688129","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4712830-1846651706685083","game_id":"steam-4712830","kind":"update","title":"Demo update 1.0.12 + 1.0.13: your feedback in action","summary":"Howdy, partners! Two demo updates in one post, both shaped by your feedback. Thanks to everyone who filled in the feedback form in the demo, keep it coming! New New \"Interface size\" setting (100-150%) in Settings > Gameplay. Text and UI scale live, in game and in the main menu. Default is now 110%. Top-down (drone) view: zoom with the mouse wheel and move the camera over the field with WASD. Dry pumps are now marked: a \"Dry\" tag appears above a pump that stopped because its deposit ran out. Clic","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T16:57:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685083","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4712830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:41:28Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:41:27Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4712830":"2026-10-26T03:41:28Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4712830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:41:27Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:41:27Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5394200":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:41:28Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:41:28Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4712830","app_id":4712830,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:48Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":